{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-d051be3bc11e","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-d051be3bc11e","name":"糖拌西红柿","category":"vegetable_dish","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/vegetable_dish/%E7%B3%96%E6%8B%8C%E8%A5%BF%E7%BA%A2%E6%9F%BF/%E7%B3%96%E6%8B%8C%E8%A5%BF%E7%BA%A2%E6%9F%BF.md","blob_sha":"972a72a0affc9754026e14ba92217754cebe890c","details":{"introduction":"这是一道适合夏季的家常凉菜，酸甜爽口，制作简便。西红柿富含维生素 C，开胃解腻。新手也能轻松完成，整个过程（包含冷藏）约 15 分钟即可上桌。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 西红柿\n- 白砂糖\n- 冰箱"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"一份正好够 2 人吃。\n\n每份：\n\n- 西红柿 2 个（每个西红柿约 100g，共 200g）\n- 白砂糖 20g"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 用刀将西红柿皮米字型划开\n2. 用筷子插入西红柿的菊花，在燃气上转动烤 10 秒（或用开水冲 30 秒），直到西红柿皮卷边\n3. 把西红柿的衣服脱光\n4. 再西红柿大卸八块（沿纹路切可以更多的留汁水），去掉头部根蒂部，备用\n5. 全部切好后，将西红柿在盘子中均匀码一层\n6. 撒上白糖，重复上面一步直到全部西红柿放完\n7. 放入冰箱冷藏 10 分钟\n8. 一盘糖拌西红柿就好了，营养美味，酸甜爽口，夏日解暑又解腻"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"在制作过程中 请您小心使用刀具。"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"标准配方估算：处理后的红熟番茄净可食量200g + 白砂糖20g，不加油或其他酱料，拌汁全部食用，成品约220g；番茄采用USDA生番茄宏量营养近似，未校正去皮及短暂加热影响。不是原菜谱实测成品。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":51.545455,"protein_g":0.8,"carbohydrate_g":12.627273,"fat_g":0.181818},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients","version":"279e14da9595094e","fdc_ids":[170457,169655]},"profile_id":"tomato-sugar-standard-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-d051be3bc11e","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"ripe_red_tomato_with_granulated_sugar","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"cold_mixed","edible_part":"prepared_tomato_flesh_and_all_juice","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"prepared_tomato_200g_sugar_20g_all_juice","tomato_edible_g":200,"granulated_sugar_g":20,"all_juice_consumed":true,"excludes":["糖量不同、代糖、其他番茄品种或配料","丢弃拌汁、继续加热或明显失水的版本","200g指去皮去蒂前整果毛重的精确计算"]},"data_version":"279e14da9595094e","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/tomato-sugar-standard-v1.7e603e1ccf0d09d2.json","bytes":13344,"sha256":"7e603e1ccf0d09d2e7460df7c000c74f92105ab6d2ed14124c696ccc4b36d3eb"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"tomato-sugar-standard-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-d051be3bc11e","recipe_blob_sha":"972a72a0affc9754026e14ba92217754cebe890c","version":"1","data_version":"279e14da9595094e","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"标准配方估算：处理后的红熟番茄净可食量200g + 白砂糖20g，不加油或其他酱料，拌汁全部食用，成品约220g；番茄采用USDA生番茄宏量营养近似，未校正去皮及短暂加热影响。不是原菜谱实测成品。","match":{"food_identity":"ripe_red_tomato_with_granulated_sugar","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"cold_mixed","edible_part":"prepared_tomato_flesh_and_all_juice","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"prepared_tomato_200g_sugar_20g_all_juice","tomato_edible_g":200,"granulated_sugar_g":20,"all_juice_consumed":true,"excludes":["糖量不同、代糖、其他番茄品种或配料","丢弃拌汁、继续加热或明显失水的版本","200g指去皮去蒂前整果毛重的精确计算"]},"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":51.545455,"protein_g":0.8,"carbohydrate_g":12.627273,"fat_g":0.181818},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients","version":"279e14da9595094e","fdc_ids":[170457,169655]},"rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","is_estimate":true,"requires_independent_match":true,"details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/tomato-sugar-standard-v1.7e603e1ccf0d09d2.json","bytes":13344,"sha256":"7e603e1ccf0d09d2e7460df7c000c74f92105ab6d2ed14124c696ccc4b36d3eb"}}]}
